<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div align="center" style=""><div align="center" style="text-align: center;"><div align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020F36970" style="font-size: medium;"><div align="center" style=""><div align="center"><div align="center"><div><table id="table_3" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246); margin-right: auto; margin-left: auto; width: 562.5pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 0cm;"><div align="center"><table id="table_1" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; width: 510pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 0cm; vertical-align: top;"><div align="center"><table id="table_2" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 0cm; width: 510pt; height: 30pt;"><p style="text-align: center; line-height: 11.25pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 7.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);" data-olk-copy-source="MailCompose">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center; line-height: 11.25pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Qantas Business Rewards</span></p><p style="line-height: 11.25pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 7.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style="text-align: center; line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><img src="data:image/png;base64," id="Picture_x0020_37" data-imagetype="AttachmentByCid" data-custom="AAkALgAAAAAAHYQDEapmEc2byACqAC%2FEWg0AMq54F9Gjo0aCp%2FB1oRzNiwAJ1a08%2FgAAARIAEABikKoV1JHtTY4QGHCGt9hG" width="679" height="70" style="width: 679px; height: 70px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"></span></p><p style="text-align: center; line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center; line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></span></p><div align="center"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="text-indent: 0px; width: 450pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 0cm; vertical-align: top;"><table id="table_0" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="text-indent: 0px; width: 450pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 0cm; vertical-align: top;"><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Hi </span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">{!Contact.FirstName},</span></p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></span></p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Thank you for contacting Qantas Business Rewards.</span></p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">To review your points activity and identify any missing Qantas Points, please log in to your Qantas Business Rewards account and select ‘Points Activity’.</span></p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></span></p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Common reasons for missing points from flights include:</span></p><div style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></div><ul data-editing-info="{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:true}" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><li style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0cm;"><p role="presentation" style="line-height: 15pt; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;"><b>Missing ABN:</b> If a flight does not appear in your Business Account, it may be due to the ABN not being added to the booking. If the travel has completed, follow the steps below to claim missing points.</p><div role="presentation" style="line-height: 15pt; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;"><br></div></li><li style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin: 0cm;"><div role="presentation" style="line-height: 15pt; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;"><b>Missing Frequent Flyer number: </b>If the booking did not include the traveler’s Frequent Flyer, the business will not earn points. You will need to get the Qantas Frequent Flyer member to claim their missing points via their Frequent Flyer account. Once this has been completed, the business can then claim the points using the process below.</div></li></ul><div style="line-height: 15pt; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></div><div style="line-height: 15pt; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">For more information or to submit a claim, visit <a href="https://agencyconnect.qantas.com/en-au/products/reward-programs/business-rewards/missing-points-claim-process" title="https://agencyconnect.qantas.com/en-au/products/reward-programs/business-rewards/missing-points-claim-process" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Claim Missing Points - Qantas Business Rewards</a> and download and complete the missing points claim form.</div><div style="line-height: 15pt; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></div><div style="line-height: 15pt; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Once you have completed this, please return it to <a href="mailto:qantasbusinessrewardsteam@qantasloyalty.com" title="mailto:qantasbusinessrewardsteam@qantasloyalty.com" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">qantasbusinessrewardsteam@qantasloyalty.com</a> for processing.</div><div style="line-height: 15pt; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></div><ul data-editing-info="{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:true}" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><li style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;"><div role="presentation" style="line-height: 15pt; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;">Points can be claimed for eligible travel completed within the past 12 months.</div></li><li style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><div role="presentation">Please ensure that all columns in the spreadsheet are completed so eligibility can be assessed.</div></li></ul><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">For more information relating to missing points, please contact the Qantas Business Rewards Service Centre on 13 74 78, available daily from 7:00am to 7:00pm AEST.</span></p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></span></p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Kind regards,</span></p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><br></span></p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">{!User.Name}</span></p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><b>Qantas Business Rewards team</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 0cm; vertical-align: top; height: 15pt;"><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 0cm; vertical-align: top; height: 15pt;"><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style="text-align: center; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><br></p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 0cm;"><div align="center"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="text-indent: 0px; width: 510pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 0cm; vertical-align: top;"><div align="center"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246); width: 510pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 0cm;"><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 0cm; vertical-align: top; width: 450pt;"><div align="center"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" style="text-indent: 0px; width: 450pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 0cm;"><p style="text-align: center; line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><img src="data:image/png;base64," id="Picture_x0020_31" data-imagetype="AttachmentByCid" data-custom="AAkALgAAAAAAHYQDEapmEc2byACqAC%2FEWg0AMq54F9Gjo0aCp%2FB1oRzNiwAJ1a08%2FgAAARIAEABMxMOsBvxYRJz8ZbZW2BJA" width="164" height="33" style="width: 164px; height: 33px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 0cm;"><div align="center"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246); width: 510pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 0cm; vertical-align: top;"><div align="center"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="text-indent: 0px; width: 450pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 0cm;"><p style="text-align: center; line-height: 9.75pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center; line-height: 9.75pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/support/contact-us.html" id="OWAc51789ca-9686-c7e8-c584-93084118b579" class="OWAAutoLink" title="Contact Us" data-auth="NotApplicable" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">Contact Us</a> | <a href="http://www.qantas.com/travel/airlines/privacy/global/en" id="OWA84f3931f-a5c8-4b8a-d182-df2aff986702" class="OWAAutoLink" title="Privacy Statement" data-auth="NotApplicable" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">Privacy Statement</a> | <a href="https://help.qantas.com/support/s/" id="OWAb081505e-07ff-742b-bb60-5cc7c6b10417" class="OWAAutoLink" title="Help &amp; Support" data-auth="NotApplicable" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">Help &amp; Support</a></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 0cm; height: 27.8pt;"><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0cm; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style="margin: 0cm; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
